    {
      "_id": "matriarchben0004",
      "name": "Warp (NPC)",
      "type": "action",
      "img": "icons/magic/unholy/beam-impact-purple.webp",
      "effects": [],
      "flags": {},
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "system": {
        "slug": "me-npc-biotic-warp",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>You suffuse a creature with destabilizing dark energy that tears apart molecular bonds and prevents regeneration.</p><p>Choose a creature within <strong>60 feet</strong>. The target must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:resolve(13+@actor.system.details.level.value+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/3))|options:me-power:me-npc-biotic-warp] save against the creature's power DC.</p><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> Unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes @Damage[(1*(1+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/4)))d6[void]] damage.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes @Damage[(2*(1+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/4)))d6[void]] damage and @Damage[(1*(1+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/4)))d4[persistent,void]] damage. The target cannot regain HP until the start of your next turn. Warp damage also deals 1.5× damage to Biotic Barriers.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but @Damage[(4*(1+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/4)))d6[void]] damage. If the target has an active Biotic Barrier, it detonates in a dark energy explosion (2d6 void in a 10-foot burst).</p><p><strong>Recharge</strong> The creature can't use this power again for [[/br 1d4 #Recharge]]{1d4 rounds}.</p><hr/><p><em>NPC version. Its DC is 13 + level + a third of level (the moderate DC for the creature's level), and its damage dice multiply every 4 levels. When a creature rolls the save, the result is applied automatically (see the Auto-Apply Power Effects setting).</em></p>",
          "gm": ""
        },
        "rules": [],
        "traits": {
          "otherTags": [],
