    {
      "_id": "matriarchben0007",
      "name": "Lift (NPC)",
      "type": "action",
      "img": "icons/magic/movement/pinwheel-blue-purple.webp",
      "effects": [],
      "flags": {},
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "system": {
        "slug": "me-npc-biotic-lift",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>You unleash an anti-gravity sphere that violently hurls nearby creatures into the air, leaving them floating helplessly.</p><p>All creatures in a @Template[burst|distance:10]{10-foot radius burst} within <strong>30 feet</strong> must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:resolve(13+@actor.system.details.level.value+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/3))|options:me-power:me-npc-biotic-lift] save against the creature's power DC.</p><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> Unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is lifted 5 feet off the ground and becomes <strong>Off-Guard</strong> until the start of your next turn.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is lifted 10 feet into the air and becomes <strong>Grabbed</strong> and <strong>Off-Guard</strong> until the start of your next turn. When the effect ends, the creature falls and takes appropriate fall damage.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the creature is lifted 20 feet and remains suspended until the end of your next turn.</p><p><strong>Recharge</strong> The creature can't use this power again for [[/br 1d4 #Recharge]]{1d4 rounds}.</p><hr/><p><em>NPC version. Its DC is 13 + level + a third of level (the moderate DC for the creature's level), and its damage dice multiply every 4 levels. When a creature rolls the save, the result is applied automatically (see the Auto-Apply Power Effects setting).</em></p>",
